{"id":"95251f310e95be8e","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-functional-interpretation.md","title":"Functional Interpretation","display":"thm-functional-interpretation — Functional Interpretation","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-functional-interpretation","aliases":["72-thm-functional-interpretation"],"display":"thm-functional-interpretation — Functional Interpretation","depends_on":["[[72-df-finite-type-arithmetic]]","[[72-df-dialectica-translation]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998; supplementary primary sources explicitly identified","source_location":"Handbook V Theorem2.4.1 and Corollary2.4.2 print348/PDF360; §2.5 print350–351/PDF362–363; §3.1 Theorem3.1.2 print352/PDF364","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","proof_status":"source theorem statement checked; full proof not reproduced or machine verified","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-functional-interpretation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-functional-interpretation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-functional-interpretation — Functional Interpretation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b4e2c27ac178897e\" href=\"?note=b4e2c27ac178897e\" title=\"72-df-finite-type-arithmetic\">72-df-finite-type-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0dfc104a5d3297ad\" href=\"?note=0dfc104a5d3297ad\" title=\"72-df-dialectica-translation\">72-df-dialectica-translation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998; supplementary primary sources explicitly identified"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Handbook V Theorem2.4.1 and Corollary2.4.2 print348/PDF360; §2.5 print350–351/PDF362–363; §3.1 Theorem3.1.2 print352/PDF364"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"source theorem statement checked; full proof not reproduced or machine verified"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_0^\\omega,T_0,PA_0\">\\(H_0^\\omega,T_0,PA_0\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b4e2c27ac178897e\" href=\"?note=b4e2c27ac178897e\" title=\"72-df-finite-type-arithmetic\">72-df-finite-type-arithmetic</a> 中明确给出的HA0^ω、Gödel T0与其一阶PA呈现；仅type0等式为原子，高型项的计算由type0 context等式表达。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal F_\\omega\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal F_\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in\\mathcal F_{ar}\">\\(B\\in\\mathcal F_{ar}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_D,A^N,w(A),c(A)\">\\(A_D,A^N,w(A),c(A)\\)</span> 及参数约定使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0dfc104a5d3297ad\" href=\"?note=0dfc104a5d3297ad\" title=\"72-df-dialectica-translation\">72-df-dialectica-translation</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_{\\vec\\rho}(Z)\">\\(\\mathcal T_{\\vec\\rho}(Z)\\)</span> 是下式定义的合法见证项元组集；当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z=\\varnothing\">\\(Z=\\varnothing\\)</span> 时全部项封闭。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\vec y\">\\(\\forall\\vec y\\)</span> 量化挑战变量表，原自由参数不被捕获。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_{\\vec\\rho}(Z):=\\{\\langle t_i:i&lt;|\\vec\\rho|\\rangle:\\forall i&lt;|\\vec\\rho|\\ (t_i\\in\\mathcal T_{\\rho_i}\\land\\operatorname{FV}(t_i)\\subseteq Z)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal T_{\\vec\\rho}(Z):=\\{\\langle t_i:i&lt;|\\vec\\rho|\\rangle:\\forall i&lt;|\\vec\\rho|\\ (t_i\\in\\mathcal T_{\\rho_i}\\land\\operatorname{FV}(t_i)\\subseteq Z)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"H_0^\\omega\\vdash A\\ \\longrightarrow\\ \\exists\\vec t\\in\\mathcal T_{w(A)}(\\operatorname{FV}(A))\\ \\bigl(T_0\\vdash A_D(\\vec t;\\vec y)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[H_0^\\omega\\vdash A\\ \\longrightarrow\\ \\exists\\vec t\\in\\mathcal T_{w(A)}(\\operatorname{FV}(A))\\ \\bigl(T_0\\vdash A_D(\\vec t;\\vec y)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"H_0^\\omega\\vdash A\\ \\longrightarrow\\ \\exists\\vec t\\in\\mathcal T_{w(A)}(\\operatorname{FV}(A))\\ \\bigl(H_0^\\omega\\vdash\\forall\\vec y\\ A_D(\\vec t;\\vec y)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[H_0^\\omega\\vdash A\\ \\longrightarrow\\ \\exists\\vec t\\in\\mathcal T_{w(A)}(\\operatorname{FV}(A))\\ \\bigl(H_0^\\omega\\vdash\\forall\\vec y\\ A_D(\\vec t;\\vec y)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"PA_0\\vdash B\\ \\longrightarrow\\ \\exists\\vec t\\in\\mathcal T_{w(B^N)}(\\operatorname{FV}(B))\\ \\bigl(T_0\\vdash(B^N)_D(\\vec t;\\vec y)\\land H_0^\\omega\\vdash\\forall\\vec y\\ (B^N)_D(\\vec t;\\vec y)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[PA_0\\vdash B\\ \\longrightarrow\\ \\exists\\vec t\\in\\mathcal T_{w(B^N)}(\\operatorname{FV}(B))\\ \\bigl(T_0\\vdash(B^N)_D(\\vec t;\\vec y)\\land H_0^\\omega\\vdash\\forall\\vec y\\ (B^N)_D(\\vec t;\\vec y)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留HA高型版本及PA负翻译后的提取内容，同时修正原稿未区分高型等式体系的问题：源print351明确说明完整外延E-HA<sup>ω不能直接用此Dialectica定理，因此这里指定源允许的HA0</sup>ω/T0对，而非任意HA<sup>ω。T0无量词定理的自由挑战变量可在HA0</sup>ω中全称化；无量词经典推理由type0原子可判定性内化。开放A所得项只可依赖原自由参数，闭句则得到封闭System T项。源2.4.1–2.4.2、3.1.2的定理陈述及高型限制已核对，完整源证明未逐行验证或机器核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-finite-type-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"b4e2c27ac178897e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-finite-type-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-dialectica-translation","status":"resolved","id":"0dfc104a5d3297ad","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-dialectica-translation]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-finite-type-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"b4e2c27ac178897e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$H_0^\\omega,T_0,PA_0$ 是 [[72-df-finite-type-arithmetic]] 中明确给出的HA0^ω、Gödel T0与其一阶PA呈现；仅type0等式为原子，高型项的计算由type0 context等式表达。$A\\in\\mathcal F_\\omega$，$B\\in\\mathcal F_{ar}$。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-dialectica-translation","status":"resolved","id":"0dfc104a5d3297ad","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A_D,A^N,w(A),c(A)$ 及参数约定使用 [[72-df-dialectica-translation]]。$\\mathcal T_{\\vec\\rho}(Z)$ 是下式定义的合法见证项元组集；当 $Z=\\varnothing$ 时全部项封闭。$\\forall\\vec y$ 量化挑战变量表，原自由参数不被捕获。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"H_0^\\omega,T_0,PA_0","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathcal F_\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"B\\in\\mathcal F_{ar}","display":false},{"tex":"A_D,A^N,w(A),c(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T_{\\vec\\rho}(Z)","display":false},{"tex":"Z=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall\\vec y","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T_{\\vec\\rho}(Z):=\\{\\langle t_i:i<|\\vec\\rho|\\rangle:\\forall i<|\\vec\\rho|\\ (t_i\\in\\mathcal T_{\\rho_i}\\land\\operatorname{FV}(t_i)\\subseteq Z)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"H_0^\\omega\\vdash A\\ \\longrightarrow\\ \\exists\\vec t\\in\\mathcal T_{w(A)}(\\operatorname{FV}(A))\\ \\bigl(T_0\\vdash A_D(\\vec t;\\vec y)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"H_0^\\omega\\vdash A\\ \\longrightarrow\\ \\exists\\vec t\\in\\mathcal T_{w(A)}(\\operatorname{FV}(A))\\ \\bigl(H_0^\\omega\\vdash\\forall\\vec y\\ A_D(\\vec t;\\vec y)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"PA_0\\vdash B\\ \\longrightarrow\\ \\exists\\vec t\\in\\mathcal T_{w(B^N)}(\\operatorname{FV}(B))\\ \\bigl(T_0\\vdash(B^N)_D(\\vec t;\\vec y)\\land H_0^\\omega\\vdash\\forall\\vec y\\ (B^N)_D(\\vec t;\\vec y)\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":2613,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-205","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-thm-functional-interpretation|thm-functional-interpretation — Functional Interpretation]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-205","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-thm-functional-interpretation|thm-functional-interpretation — Functional Interpretation]]"},{"id":"b8200155e858da77","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"提取接口和证据限制来自 [[72-thm-functional-interpretation]]；矩阵展开来自 [[72-lem-dialectica-pi02-equation-matrix]]。指称、赋值集合及更新使用 [[72-df-system-t-denotation]]；T0模型可靠性来自 [[72-thm-system-t-quantifier-free-soundness]]，指称的自由变量与代入性质来自 [[72-lem-system-t-semantic-substitution]]。"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-292","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-thm-functional-interpretation|72-thm-functional-interpretation]]"}],"outgoing":["b4e2c27ac178897e","0dfc104a5d3297ad"]}